# The big per-platform training CSVs (tens/hundreds of MB each) aren't read
# by app.py at runtime -- only train_models.py uses them, offline. The small
# demo_*.csv files ARE needed (app.py loads them for the username lookup).
data/*.csv
!data/demo_*.csv
data/*.txt
data/*.md
